<!--=====================================================
  OCULUS VR -  DEFAULT VOLUME TABLES

  v1.0 2020-05-06:
  - Created all OVR volume curves for Media, Voice and System Sounds, each
    one for HEADSET and SPEAKER outputs.
  - Modified MEDIA_HEADSET to be steeper
  - MEDIA_SPEAKER curve is unchanged
  - SYSTEM curves are shallow
  2020-06-30
  - Increase 6 dB at volume steps 2-8 and drop more at vol step 1.
  - Steeper drop from 15 to 14 dB.
=====================================================
-->


